0,Hoyahoya language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hoyahoya_language,"April 9, 2026 - Hoyahoya (Matakia) is an Anim language spoken in the village of Matakaia (7°50′45″S 143°14′49″E / 7.845775°S 143.246807°E) of Bamu Rural LLG in Western Province, Papua New Guinea. It shares its name with the closely related Hoia Hoia language.",Hoyahoya,Trans-New Guinea
